克拉约韦亚努 ","text":"这种湿度，室外石板地肯定返潮打滑。待会儿晨练一组直接去室内环廊集合，免得负重练一半有人摔破膝盖。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:41:44.730Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674077194_ndf3gn5","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789668394217","_id":5423},{"id":1789685010358,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"17b0cb77-05fc-4075-a046-0922f54edc39","senderName":"凯利安","text":"马房那边刚才也来人了，大雾混着霜气，马匹鬃毛全挂了湿雾，原定的越野骑行训练大概率要改理论课。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:41:47.345Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674077194_ndf3gn5","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789668394217","_id":5424},{"id":1789685010359,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"67d4e7d5-381a-44ff-99e2-077c6f669f71","senderName":"临彦·萨伏伊","text":"阿姆林河口的航道黄色预警还没撤，东门城码头压了至少四艘平底驳船，顺流下来的货期多半得顺延半天。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:41:50.161Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674077194_ndf3gn5","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789668394217","_id":5425},{"id":1789685010360,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"4810cbbe-8db5-4c27-bd2b-b00b99bf8340","senderName":"伊恩·法尔","text":"滞港费按规矩由货运商行自行承担，要是敢算进学院耗材的运费明细里，这批单据我一张都不会盖章签字。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:41:53.031Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674077194_ndf3gn5","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789668394217","_id":5426},{"id":1789685010361,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"9d19b7b3-d459-46c3-b77a-6341aac527e9","senderName":"扬库·扎洛米尔","text":"墙缝全是冷汗一样的水珠，纳帕克一直缩在箱子里不肯出来。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:41:57.462Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674077194_ndf3gn5","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789668394217","_id":5427},{"id":1789685010362,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"18ba74f2-5dbb-449b-a6e6-4b07d97cacbd","senderName":"瓦莱里乌·巴兰","text":"礼堂底层的排风道大概也被湿气堵住了，旧木料返潮的沉闷气味一直顺着管子往隐修室这边渗。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:42:02.060Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674077194_ndf3gn5","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789668394217","_id":5428},{"id":1789685010363,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"6db50233-3e6f-40e4-87f5-e95be05a6ecb","senderName":"赫尔曼·瓦伦","text":"清晨巡视会通知杂务组排查通风井。若发现有人违规在风道堆积杂物，一律按违纪通报。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:42:04.873Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674077194_ndf3gn5","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789668394217","_id":5429},{"id":1789685010364,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"17b0cb77-05fc-4075-a046-0922f54edc39","senderName":"凯利安","text":"把滤糖茶匙拿去盛燕麦浓汤，亏后勤部想得出来。那种轻飘飘又容易卡油垢的镂空柄，在贵族礼仪课上拿来搅红茶都要被扣礼仪分。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:42:47.104Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5430},{"id":1789685010365,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35b87f1b-532b-47f5-bfcd-6149e60035a1","senderName":"雅克·奥尔德鲁丁","text":"大少爷你就别讲究花架子了，老子只想早训完五分钟内把糊糊全咽下去！@阿瑞奥斯 那白蜡木的给我留两把，训练完我顺路去小卖部拿。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:42:48.765Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5431},{"id":1789685010366,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"24f404b9-7efd-4512-b1c4-2bcf89d697aa","senderName":"西夫伦","text":"那个……我之前也吃过亏……上周黑麦面包硬得切不开，我想用微弱的火星热一下那个铁勺去切黄油，结果……镂空的地方太薄，直接熔化掉了一小截锡水在碗里……对不起！","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:42:53.796Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5432},{"id":1789685010367,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"6db50233-3e6f-40e4-87f5-e95be05a6ecb","senderName":"赫尔曼·瓦伦","text":"西夫伦，食堂明文禁止在公共餐具上施加未经报备的塑能系法术。再有下次，按损坏公共资产扣除操行分两分。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:42:56.458Z","replyTo":{"id":1789685010366,"text":"那个……我之前也吃过亏……上周黑麦面包硬得切不开，我想用微弱的火星热一下那个铁勺去切黄油，结果……镂空的地方太薄，直接熔化掉了一小截锡水在碗里……对不起！","sender":"them","senderName":"西夫伦"},"roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5433},{"id":1789685010368,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"24f404b9-7efd-4512-b1c4-2bcf89d697aa","senderName":"西夫伦","text":"对不起赫尔曼学长！我当时立刻用抹布擦掉了！绝对没有咽下去！真的对不起！","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:42:58.129Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5434},{"id":1789685010369,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ab4216bf-aa8a-42fb-9505-7f775f331aec","senderName":"尤利西斯","text":"那种镂空工艺的配重粗制滥造到了极点，重心完全偏在柄端三分之一处，拿在手里连最基本的杠杆平衡都维持不了。无论是作为餐具还是作为工艺品，都是对力学美感的侮辱。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:43:00.906Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5435},{"id":1789685010370,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"2fd090de-6441-4fd0-932c-f0cb0092dd8b","senderName":"米尔恰·克拉约韦亚努 ","text":"哈哈哈哈！管它什么美感不美感，勺子只要口子够深、盛得满炖肉就行。换成白蜡木或者精钢的，至少砸桌上不会扁。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:43:03.729Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5436},{"id":1789685010371,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"67d4e7d5-381a-44ff-99e2-077c6f669f71","senderName":"临彦·萨伏伊","text":"阿姆林河沿线的几处驻军补给站也经常把这种滞销礼仪存货往下甩。这几日河口雾气重，潮气上涌，劣质镀锡件两天就会起红斑。@伊恩·法尔 换批次时注意避开含铅锡合金，别为了省运费进受潮氧化的货。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:43:06.426Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5437},{"id":1789685010372,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"4810cbbe-8db5-4c27-bd2b-b00b99bf8340","senderName":"伊恩·法尔","text":"后勤库房没那么瞎。小卖部要是进整批的烘干白蜡木深勺，走平底货船的拼箱配额，运费能再压掉两成。谁还要报个数，我统一列在耗材交接单的副页上。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:43:09.243Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5438},{"id":1789685010373,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"18ba74f2-5dbb-449b-a6e6-4b07d97cacbd","senderName":"瓦莱里乌·巴兰","text":"我也需要一把木勺。早晨煎服苦蓟药汁时，金属器皿的气味容易破坏药性……如果边缘打磨得足够温和，算我一个。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:43:13.892Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5439},{"id":1789685010374,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"065c4529-288c-4828-8e6d-a8eb7b4f97bb","senderName":"卢卡斯·贝文","text":"等等！既然大家都要换实心勺，那批淘汰下来的镂空勺真的不能低价转给庆典部吗？拿镀金漆喷一遍挂在后台当占卜道具，看着可唬人了！","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:43:15.588Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674147031_mmbx23t","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789647024312","_id":5440},{"id":1789685010375,"sender":"me","text":"居然还有这种事","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:44:11.132Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1783089244415","_id":5441},{"id":1789685010376,"sender":"me","text":"aaa新的接龙需要的订单！","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:44:39.424Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1782934896050","_id":5442},{"id":1789685010377,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"我在！登记板和羊皮纸都准备好啦，亲爱的别急~","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:45:08.855Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674280398_3al21ty","reactions":["❤️"],"userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1782934896050","_id":5443},{"id":1789685010378,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","senderName":"阿瑞奥斯","text":"[群接龙] 魔药与炼金耗材定制接龙","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:45:11.466Z","chainData":{"id":"chain_mu5xvkmi_i0632","chainId":"chain_mu5xvkmi_tm7yj","title":"魔药与炼金耗材定制接龙","template":"姓名+需求物品+期望取货时间","status":"open","createdAt":1789674311466,"creatorName":"阿瑞奥斯","creatorCharId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","creatorIsUser":false,"entries":[{"id":"e_mu5xvkmi_m2yti","name":"阿瑞奥斯","isUser":false,"charId":"743a1f93-ffaf-48e6-bd01-c4794aa19040","avatar":"","text":"1. 阿瑞奥斯 - 银叶草浸膏与洋甘菊纯露（店用补充）","at":1789674311466}]},"roundId":"group_round_1789674280398_3al21ty","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1782934896050","_id":5444}]